(1091854, 131956, 31213, '<td valign="top">I think this picture is oversaturated.  I don''t know if you over adjusted in post or have your camera settings a little funky.  The sky is an odd blue and the right bricks are much more orange than they probably really are.  Nice shot though</td>', 'I think this picture is oversaturated.  I don''t know if you over adjusted in post or have your camera settings a little funky.  The sky is an odd blue and the right bricks are much more orange than they probably really are.  Nice shot though', '2005-01-05 00:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
