(1091857, 133106, 17507, '<td valign="top">I like this one for (a) its scale, (b) the dinky size of the Waldo(es), and (c) the fact that despite the smallness of the Waldoes, they are clearly people.</td>', 'I like this one for (a) its scale, (b) the dinky size of the Waldo(es), and (c) the fact that despite the smallness of the Waldoes, they are clearly people.', '2005-01-05 00:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
