(1091861, 132500, 31213, '<td valign="top">I wish she wasn''t holding the red sled.  I think it would be a little more powerful without it.  I feel like this image demonstrates the human/nature relationship.  Perhaps if you ahd made it black and white she could still be holding the sled without a problem.  Nice shot though.</td>', 'I wish she wasn''t holding the red sled.  I think it would be a little more powerful without it.  I feel like this image demonstrates the human/nature relationship.  Perhaps if you ahd made it black and white she could still be holding the sled without a problem.  Nice shot though.', '2005-01-05 00:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091864, 132980, 31213, '<td valign="top">Nothing in this picture is in focus!  It may have been in focus before you edited it.  Almost looks a bit pixely with some interpolation.  Nice attempt.</td>', 'Nothing in this picture is in focus!  It may have been in focus before you edited it.  Almost looks a bit pixely with some interpolation.  Nice attempt.', '2005-01-05 00:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
