(1091873, 132623, 31213, '<td valign="top">Although Waldo is to be "hidden" in this challenge I would have liked to seen more of your subject.  The placement of the table is good in the frame, but the bundle of person in front of it rubs me the wrong way.  Also there is a lot of photo "debri" in this picture.  It would have been a much better shot if you cropped out the unnatural buidlings and structures in the background.</td>', 'Although Waldo is to be "hidden" in this challenge I would have liked to seen more of your subject.  The placement of the table is good in the frame, but the bundle of person in front of it rubs me the wrong way.  Also there is a lot of photo "debri" in this picture.  It would have been a much better shot if you cropped out the unnatural buidlings and structures in the background.', '2005-01-05 01:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
