(1092040, 132273, 22479, '<td valign="top">Revisiting. Ooh...big flames, brings out the old pyromaniac in me! :-)<br/> <br/>Quite a stunning presentation and the silhouette effectively puts this in the "Meets challenge" column. Bumping up.</td>', 'Revisiting. Ooh...big flames, brings out the old pyromaniac in me! :-) Quite a stunning presentation and the silhouette effectively puts this in the "Meets challenge" column. Bumping up.', '2005-01-05 02:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092044, 131981, 22479, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to figure this one out! Great detail and I like the play of light and shadow. The pincushioning effect is unfortunate but not enough to be an issue. Well done.</td>', 'Took me a while to figure this one out! Great detail and I like the play of light and shadow. The pincushioning effect is unfortunate but not enough to be an issue. Well done.', '2005-01-05 02:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
