(1092504, 131485, 16648, '<td valign="top">Composition needs work - perhaps reposition yourself to the left and lower a tad- the walking bridge is not level and the building in the left rear keeps drawing my eye.</td>', 'Composition needs work - perhaps reposition yourself to the left and lower a tad- the walking bridge is not level and the building in the left rear keeps drawing my eye.', '2005-01-05 09:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092507, 132258, 24890, '<td valign="top">I love this photo... Very thought provoking.... My only (10) so far...</td>', 'I love this photo... Very thought provoking.... My only (10) so far...', '2005-01-05 09:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092509, 132426, 24890, '<td valign="top">Love it! (10)</td>', 'Love it! (10)', '2005-01-05 09:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092510, 133166, 16648, '<td valign="top">A bit busy - the tree on the left and the pond up front , the swingset and fence on the right...and the focus seems soft, sould be the flat lighting, and it does not seem level.<br/>On the + side, it meets the challenge and has no bad border. And it is not b&amp;w. I am getting tired of b&amp;w.<br/> <br/>perhaps move left and lower - the pond in teh foreground is a good idea, but there is not enouhg of it here. more telephoto lens perhaps to narrow the field of view and cut out the swings.  Definitely needs some better focus and/or some USM in PP.</td>', 'A bit busy - the tree on the left and the pond up front , the swingset and fence on the right...and the focus seems soft, sould be the flat lighting, and it does not seem level.On the + side, it meets the challenge and has no bad border. And it is not b&w. I am getting tired of b&w. perhaps move left and lower - the pond in teh foreground is a good idea, but there is not enouhg of it here. more telephoto lens perhaps to narrow the field of view and cut out the swings.  Definitely needs some better focus and/or some USM in PP.', '2005-01-05 09:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092511, 133024, 24890, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery... The background seems a bit washed out to me...not a very vibrant color in the ocean...</td>', 'Beautiful scenery... The background seems a bit washed out to me...not a very vibrant color in the ocean...', '2005-01-05 09:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092512, 132662, 16648, '<td valign="top">Nice. The sky seems a bit dull and perhaps a tad noisy. Did you try this with a polarizer filter? - it might have helped add drama to the sky. I almost never shoot outside without one.</td>', 'Nice. The sky seems a bit dull and perhaps a tad noisy. Did you try this with a polarizer filter? - it might have helped add drama to the sky. I almost never shoot outside without one.', '2005-01-05 09:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
