(1092516, 132295, 16648, '<td valign="top">Wxcellent composition. THe angles shoreline directs me to the bridge, and that across to the person.   I am getting burned out on b&amp;w, but it works here. If only the steps in the snow were not there or shoveled. The truck on the bridge is a minor distraction.</td>', 'Wxcellent composition. THe angles shoreline directs me to the bridge, and that across to the person.   I am getting burned out on b&w, but it works here. If only the steps in the snow were not there or shoveled. The truck on the bridge is a minor distraction.', '2005-01-05 09:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
