(1092731, 131569, 31133, '<td valign="top">The apple and the two candles in front are in nice focus. I would''ve liked to see the back candle in better focus. I like the way the apple is lit on only the top quarter. Can''t really see Waldo unless he/she is a tiny reflection in the left candle.</td>', 'The apple and the two candles in front are in nice focus. I would''ve liked to see the back candle in better focus. I like the way the apple is lit on only the top quarter. Can''t really see Waldo unless he/she is a tiny reflection in the left candle.', '2005-01-05 11:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
