(1092742, 132541, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful with the reflections, the color, and the fact that Waldo fits so naturally. I also like that even though it''s foggy, the reflections show so well. The only thing I wish is that the red boad (I have a weakness for red rowboats) was a little more prominent.</td>', 'This is so beautiful with the reflections, the color, and the fact that Waldo fits so naturally. I also like that even though it''s foggy, the reflections show so well. The only thing I wish is that the red boad (I have a weakness for red rowboats) was a little more prominent.', '2005-01-05 11:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092744, 132943, 20889, '<td valign="top">neat ideal, was that on glass?</td>', 'neat ideal, was that on glass?', '2005-01-05 11:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092745, 133102, 31133, '<td valign="top">Really, really nice! You made it especially interesting by making each frame, or lack thereof, so different, but the time period of the "paintings" appears intended to be similar. 10.</td>', 'Really, really nice! You made it especially interesting by making each frame, or lack thereof, so different, but the time period of the "paintings" appears intended to be similar. 10.', '2005-01-05 11:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
