(1092775, 132336, 21216, '<td valign="top">Pretty lanscape, I would like to know if you used an IR filter or if you created this photoshop if so how? <br/> <br/>Though the scenery is well there are a lot of things wrong here, for one thing it looks as if you took this picture just for the landscape and not so it could meet the challenge. The horizon is too tilted and I think maybe having a better angle would have been better, for exemple seeing more of the house  and making Waldo blend better into the trees. <br/> <br/>Though it is a good image.</td>', 'Pretty lanscape, I would like to know if you used an IR filter or if you created this photoshop if so how?  Though the scenery is well there are a lot of things wrong here, for one thing it looks as if you took this picture just for the landscape and not so it could meet the challenge. The horizon is too tilted and I think maybe having a better angle would have been better, for exemple seeing more of the house  and making Waldo blend better into the trees.  Though it is a good image.', '2005-01-05 11:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1092794, 132249, 27636, '<td valign="top">Very funny... this one made me laugh... :)</td>', 'Very funny... this one made me laugh... :)', '2005-01-05 12:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
