(1093280, 133448, 4210, '<td valign="top">Interesting and nicely done, but I wish this photo had more "height" to it, instead of being square.</td>', 'Interesting and nicely done, but I wish this photo had more "height" to it, instead of being square.', '2005-01-05 15:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
