(1093285, 133222, 4210, '<td valign="top">Definately meets the challenge, but doesn''t do anything for me visually. The tree branch in the top left is destracting as well.</td>', 'Definately meets the challenge, but doesn''t do anything for me visually. The tree branch in the top left is destracting as well.', '2005-01-05 15:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
