(1096570, 132826, 29513, '<td valign="top">I know that sometimes you have to take what you can get but the shadow along the horse''s side and back is distracting.  Otherwise the colors and framing and sharpness are very good.</td>', 'I know that sometimes you have to take what you can get but the shadow along the horse''s side and back is distracting.  Otherwise the colors and framing and sharpness are very good.', '2005-01-07 23:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
