(1097114, 133471, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your person blends in very well with the baclground. Without the scarf, I wouldn''t have found her. The picture''s not very interesting though. I lacks contrast and sharpness, and the snowflakes are rather distracting. 4.</td>', 'Your person blends in very well with the baclground. Without the scarf, I wouldn''t have found her. The picture''s not very interesting though. I lacks contrast and sharpness, and the snowflakes are rather distracting. 4.', '2005-01-08 13:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097115, 132270, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool building. I like your composition. The cityscape is a bit distracting, but that''s okay. You might have hidden your Waldo in one of the phone booths, but I guess you couldn''t control that. Nice shot. 8.</td>', 'Cool building. I like your composition. The cityscape is a bit distracting, but that''s okay. You might have hidden your Waldo in one of the phone booths, but I guess you couldn''t control that. Nice shot. 8.', '2005-01-08 13:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097118, 133455, 27845, '<td valign="top">I think there''s someone on the steps in the far right side of the picture, but I''m not even sure. So: you did a good job hiding your person. I like the texture of the building, the decoration and ornaments are interesting. I think you should have cropped away the grass, it doesn''t fit the otherwise very harmonic and well applied duotone. 8.</td>', 'I think there''s someone on the steps in the far right side of the picture, but I''m not even sure. So: you did a good job hiding your person. I like the texture of the building, the decoration and ornaments are interesting. I think you should have cropped away the grass, it doesn''t fit the otherwise very harmonic and well applied duotone. 8.', '2005-01-08 13:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097119, 132258, 19507, '<td valign="top">Nice, atmospheric shot.  Good use of black and white.</td>', 'Nice, atmospheric shot.  Good use of black and white.', '2005-01-08 13:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1097120, 133179, 19507, '<td valign="top">Took me awhle to find the person in this one.  Interesting shot.</td>', 'Took me awhle to find the person in this one.  Interesting shot.', '2005-01-08 13:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
