(1097123, 132688, 27845, '<td valign="top">A very good night shot. I like the small stars around the lights, it''s not too much, just right. I also like the blue and yellow colours, the picture is well saturated. Your peson found a nie hiding place, she (?) almost disappears behind the detailed fence. 9.</td>', 'A very good night shot. I like the small stars around the lights, it''s not too much, just right. I also like the blue and yellow colours, the picture is well saturated. Your peson found a nie hiding place, she (?) almost disappears behind the detailed fence. 9.', '2005-01-08 13:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
