(1097137, 131679, 27845, '<td valign="top">A stunnin b&amp;w picture. I love the detail and the contrast. The composition looks good, not too tight. Your person is hidden very well, perhaps you shouldn''t have given the hint in your title, even though it sounds good. You deserve a 10.</td>', 'A stunnin b&w picture. I love the detail and the contrast. The composition looks good, not too tight. Your person is hidden very well, perhaps you shouldn''t have given the hint in your title, even though it sounds good. You deserve a 10.', '2005-01-08 13:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
