(1097833, 133179, 31214, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...I may have cropped it differently (distracting on top) but I still like it.</td>', 'Nice shot...I may have cropped it differently (distracting on top) but I still like it.', '2005-01-09 03:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
