(1098044, 133193, 15204, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  The lighting and colors look great as does the baby''s skin tone (which can be hard).  The only thing that detracts from the shot is the background.  A sheet (or similar) hung behind the bassinet would be a big improvement.</td>', 'Very cute!  The lighting and colors look great as does the baby''s skin tone (which can be hard).  The only thing that detracts from the shot is the background.  A sheet (or similar) hung behind the bassinet would be a big improvement.', '2005-01-09 09:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098048, 132981, 15204, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle of this shot.  Instead of looking straight down the alley, I like how the columns lead the eye to the right of the shot.  It makes a very nice composition. 7</td>', 'I really like the angle of this shot.  Instead of looking straight down the alley, I like how the columns lead the eye to the right of the shot.  It makes a very nice composition. 7', '2005-01-09 09:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098110, 131956, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love the combination of white snow and blue skies.  You have done a very good job keeping your whites bright, with just a minimal amout of burn-out.</td>', 'I love the combination of white snow and blue skies.  You have done a very good job keeping your whites bright, with just a minimal amout of burn-out.', '2005-01-09 11:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098111, 133122, 1024, '<td valign="top">great composition and your waldo is just hard enough to find thar I looked at this a second time.  Good luck!</td>', 'great composition and your waldo is just hard enough to find thar I looked at this a second time.  Good luck!', '2005-01-09 11:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098113, 132957, 1024, '<td valign="top">Good chpice for black and white.  I am wishing your tones were just a little richer, but over all very good photograph.</td>', 'Good chpice for black and white.  I am wishing your tones were just a little richer, but over all very good photograph.', '2005-01-09 11:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098116, 133391, 1024, '<td valign="top">The basic idea here is a very good one, but if you had not centered the tower exactly in the middle of the photo it would have held my interest longer.</td>', 'The basic idea here is a very good one, but if you had not centered the tower exactly in the middle of the photo it would have held my interest longer.', '2005-01-09 11:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098117, 132336, 1024, '<td valign="top">Wow, wonderful photograph.  Your tones are rich and dynamic.  Waldo is hid well enough that I had to come back for a second look.  Good luck.</td>', 'Wow, wonderful photograph.  Your tones are rich and dynamic.  Waldo is hid well enough that I had to come back for a second look.  Good luck.', '2005-01-09 11:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098118, 133271, 27845, '<td valign="top">I think you completely missed the challenge. *Hide* a person. Hide *a* person, not 10. Hide a person in an otherwise *personless* photgraph.<br/>Furthermore, you cut the faces of the children in the last row. The children look a little bored and shy. 1.</td>', 'I think you completely missed the challenge. *Hide* a person. Hide *a* person, not 10. Hide a person in an otherwise *personless* photgraph.Furthermore, you cut the faces of the children in the last row. The children look a little bored and shy. 1.', '2005-01-09 11:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098119, 132534, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very interesting "peeping tom" premise and well executed.  Black and white tones work well for this.</td>', 'Very interesting "peeping tom" premise and well executed.  Black and white tones work well for this.', '2005-01-09 11:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098120, 132164, 27845, '<td valign="top">Needs more colour, brightness and contrast. It looks too much like the DPC colour around the image. 1.</td>', 'Needs more colour, brightness and contrast. It looks too much like the DPC colour around the image. 1.', '2005-01-09 11:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098121, 133196, 1024, '<td valign="top">You took what looks like an overcast day and used it to your advantasge.  Your colors are saturated and your details sharp.  I especially like the compositional leading line of the path.  Sorry this is not more helpful, I just like this photo the way it is.  Good luck</td>', 'You took what looks like an overcast day and used it to your advantasge.  Your colors are saturated and your details sharp.  I especially like the compositional leading line of the path.  Sorry this is not more helpful, I just like this photo the way it is.  Good luck', '2005-01-09 11:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098122, 132957, 27845, '<td valign="top">A cool picture, I like the perspective. But your person looks strange! Somehow the face is flat, as if it were a cutout or something. 7.</td>', 'A cool picture, I like the perspective. But your person looks strange! Somehow the face is flat, as if it were a cutout or something. 7.', '2005-01-09 11:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098124, 132501, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the challenge idea.  I like your idea but do not think you executed it in the best possible way, the glassware on the left has blown out highlights and that draws my attention away from the remainder of the photo.</td>', 'Very interesting take on the challenge idea.  I like your idea but do not think you executed it in the best possible way, the glassware on the left has blown out highlights and that draws my attention away from the remainder of the photo.', '2005-01-09 11:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098125, 132506, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your person is well hidden, but I don''t like the colours of the mountain, it is too brown, not very interesting. 5.</td>', 'Your person is well hidden, but I don''t like the colours of the mountain, it is too brown, not very interesting. 5.', '2005-01-09 11:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098126, 133389, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your pictue is tilted. The wall on the right is too big, you should have cropped it away. Your person is well hidden, mostly because the viewer''s attention is drawn towards the bright areas. 5.</td>', 'Your pictue is tilted. The wall on the right is too big, you should have cropped it away. Your person is well hidden, mostly because the viewer''s attention is drawn towards the bright areas. 5.', '2005-01-09 11:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098128, 131991, 1024, '<td valign="top">Nice bright photo with a little mystery.  I have a real soft spot for cottoncandy water.  Good luck</td>', 'Nice bright photo with a little mystery.  I have a real soft spot for cottoncandy water.  Good luck', '2005-01-09 11:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098130, 133251, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your picture has a heavy colour cast. You should fix the white balance, and give it some more contrast. Then, your person is not hidden at all. You should have photographed someone walking within the parade, making him disappear among boasting colours. 2.</td>', 'Your picture has a heavy colour cast. You should fix the white balance, and give it some more contrast. Then, your person is not hidden at all. You should have photographed someone walking within the parade, making him disappear among boasting colours. 2.', '2005-01-09 11:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098135, 131632, 27845, '<td valign="top">A nice pictue of a cool looking house. Your person is well hidden.<br/>Your sky is blown out, the snow ground lacks detail. You might have chosen a tighter crop, about 50% of the picture, leaving the tractor in. 4.</td>', 'A nice pictue of a cool looking house. Your person is well hidden.Your sky is blown out, the snow ground lacks detail. You might have chosen a tighter crop, about 50% of the picture, leaving the tractor in. 4.', '2005-01-09 11:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098136, 131853, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites from this challenge.  Its wonderful to see a good example of "improper" white balance being used in a creative way.  I love how the walls seeem to have an internal glow.  Very appropriate for a church.  very well done.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites from this challenge.  Its wonderful to see a good example of "improper" white balance being used in a creative way.  I love how the walls seeem to have an internal glow.  Very appropriate for a church.  very well done.', '2005-01-09 11:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098137, 133044, 28108, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot! Wow! Gorgeous! The only (small) detail that could have improved would have been to clone out thinner branches on top, I find it a bit distracting but hey!...  that''s nature.  I would also like this shot with the post and cables out just for comparison.  The colours are just amazing, the foggy horizon is beautiful. I just started looking at pics for this challenge, yours is one of the very firsts but I wouldn''t be surprise to see it end up in the top three.</td>', 'Fabulous shot! Wow! Gorgeous! The only (small) detail that could have improved would have been to clone out thinner branches on top, I find it a bit distracting but hey!...  that''s nature.  I would also like this shot with the post and cables out just for comparison.  The colours are just amazing, the foggy horizon is beautiful. I just started looking at pics for this challenge, yours is one of the very firsts but I wouldn''t be surprise to see it end up in the top three.', '2005-01-09 11:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098143, 132249, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your picture''s not very interesting from the technical pint of view, the lighting is too boring and the composition isn''t very appealing. You might have put the microwave oven somewhere else.<br/>BUT the photograph is incredibly funny. Your person is not very well hidden in the picture, but in real life, this would be the best possible hiding place. You gave me a good laugh, which saves your score: 8.</td>', 'Your picture''s not very interesting from the technical pint of view, the lighting is too boring and the composition isn''t very appealing. You might have put the microwave oven somewhere else.BUT the photograph is incredibly funny. Your person is not very well hidden in the picture, but in real life, this would be the best possible hiding place. You gave me a good laugh, which saves your score: 8.', '2005-01-09 11:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098147, 133193, 28108, '<td valign="top">Aw... So cute!</td>', 'Aw... So cute!', '2005-01-09 11:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098151, 133102, 27845, '<td valign="top">Really creative idea. The woman really fits the look and moos of the other two pictures. I like your approach to the challenge. Sometimes the best way to hide somethign is to make it blatantly obvious. The perspectives work very well, I think it was really hard to get that right. The lighting is well done, too: the pictures have no distracting glares, and the person looks as if she was independent of the overall lighting. ...You didn''t use a photo after all, did you? ;) Great shot. Your shot being so different owes you a few extra points. I give you a ten.</td>', 'Really creative idea. The woman really fits the look and moos of the other two pictures. I like your approach to the challenge. Sometimes the best way to hide somethign is to make it blatantly obvious. The perspectives work very well, I think it was really hard to get that right. The lighting is well done, too: the pictures have no distracting glares, and the person looks as if she was independent of the overall lighting. ...You didn''t use a photo after all, did you? ;) Great shot. Your shot being so different owes you a few extra points. I give you a ten.', '2005-01-09 11:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098155, 131679, 1024, '<td valign="top">I like this composition except for the little bit of wall on the extreme lower left.  Its small enough not to be important ot the photo, but large enogh to be distracting.  Have you tried to crop it out?  That might move this photo up one full point from me.  I do think the black and white are most appropriate, and the sky adds a degree of interest. Nice job overall.</td>', 'I like this composition except for the little bit of wall on the extreme lower left.  Its small enough not to be important ot the photo, but large enogh to be distracting.  Have you tried to crop it out?  That might move this photo up one full point from me.  I do think the black and white are most appropriate, and the sky adds a degree of interest. Nice job overall.', '2005-01-09 11:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098156, 133024, 27845, '<td valign="top">The sky looks a little washed out, and the foreground is too much out of focus. You might have cropped it away from the hedge behind which your person hides downwards. It is an interesting place. I bet it''s much more impressive in real life. 5.</td>', 'The sky looks a little washed out, and the foreground is too much out of focus. You might have cropped it away from the hedge behind which your person hides downwards. It is an interesting place. I bet it''s much more impressive in real life. 5.', '2005-01-09 11:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098158, 133450, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the colours. A bit unsharp, the reflecting background is distracting. 5.</td>', 'I like the colours. A bit unsharp, the reflecting background is distracting. 5.', '2005-01-09 11:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098163, 132723, 1024, '<td valign="top">Your composition is interest enough for a second look but your colors seems a little muted.  You may have done this on purpose, but personally I would have increased the saturation/contrast just a bit.  Your waldo is well hidden, it took me awhile to spot her.</td>', 'Your composition is interest enough for a second look but your colors seems a little muted.  You may have done this on purpose, but personally I would have increased the saturation/contrast just a bit.  Your waldo is well hidden, it took me awhile to spot her.', '2005-01-09 11:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098166, 133207, 27845, '<td valign="top">Gave me a good laugh, but the picture as such isn''t very interesting. You might have straightened it, turned it b&amp;w or duotone (as there  re no interesting colours anyways). You should have filled the bath tube, and as you couldn''t place a second person in it, one of those yellow ducks and some foam, maby a bottle of champagne and a book. That IMO would have made it a much better picture. 4.</td>', 'Gave me a good laugh, but the picture as such isn''t very interesting. You might have straightened it, turned it b&w or duotone (as there  re no interesting colours anyways). You should have filled the bath tube, and as you couldn''t place a second person in it, one of those yellow ducks and some foam, maby a bottle of champagne and a book. That IMO would have made it a much better picture. 4.', '2005-01-09 11:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098167, 132630, 1024, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice and bright and your composition is interesting, although maybe a little busy.  overall a nice job. Good luck.</td>', 'The colors are nice and bright and your composition is interesting, although maybe a little busy.  overall a nice job. Good luck.', '2005-01-09 11:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098170, 131962, 28108, '<td valign="top">There''s a dark spot in the road that should have been cloned out (this isn''t Waldo is it?).  I like the contrast in the tones.</td>', 'There''s a dark spot in the road that should have been cloned out (this isn''t Waldo is it?).  I like the contrast in the tones.', '2005-01-09 11:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098174, 132764, 27845, '<td valign="top">There''s no composition in here. Just a big mess, nowhere to focus on, nol ines, no structure. You might have found another way to hide your person than to show the guy''s reflection (which looks shaky due to the double glass). The bright reflected sky is very distracting. 1.</td>', 'There''s no composition in here. Just a big mess, nowhere to focus on, nol ines, no structure. You might have found another way to hide your person than to show the guy''s reflection (which looks shaky due to the double glass). The bright reflected sky is very distracting. 1.', '2005-01-09 11:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098177, 131574, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective on this one, also the use of black and white.  I wish the tones were a bit richer though, the blacks truly black and the whites truly white.  Overall aa very interesting photograph.  Good luck.</td>', 'I love the perspective on this one, also the use of black and white.  I wish the tones were a bit richer though, the blacks truly black and the whites truly white.  Overall aa very interesting photograph.  Good luck.', '2005-01-09 11:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098179, 133228, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. The title fits well. Your person is really tiny, it cculd just as well be a tree, so I''m not sure if I found her. You might have tried a different crop: 1/3 water and 2/3 sky. 6.</td>', 'Nice colours. The title fits well. Your person is really tiny, it cculd just as well be a tree, so I''m not sure if I found her. You might have tried a different crop: 1/3 water and 2/3 sky. 6.', '2005-01-09 11:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098182, 132312, 27845, '<td valign="top">Too bright. Darken it and push the contrast. There is no real structure, the fore- and background cannot be distinguished. 2.</td>', 'Too bright. Darken it and push the contrast. There is no real structure, the fore- and background cannot be distinguished. 2.', '2005-01-09 11:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098184, 133412, 27845, '<td valign="top">Well hidden. A bit messy. You might turn it sepia. 5.</td>', 'Well hidden. A bit messy. You might turn it sepia. 5.', '2005-01-09 11:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098190, 132980, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the challenge.  I love the composition and the idea behind it.  The focus seems a little soft on the foreground, perhaps a sharper focus might draw the eye to the waldo a bit better?</td>', 'Very interesting take on the challenge.  I love the composition and the idea behind it.  The focus seems a little soft on the foreground, perhaps a sharper focus might draw the eye to the waldo a bit better?', '2005-01-09 11:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098196, 132673, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love the combination of white snow and blue skies and I love the way you have added one more interest, the backlit hair is wonderful and gives a definate interest to your waldo.  Very well done. (If this had not been the Wheres Waldo challenge I would have suggested a tighter crop to bri ng more focus to the lady, but your crop is completely appropriate here)  Well done and good luck!</td>', 'I love the combination of white snow and blue skies and I love the way you have added one more interest, the backlit hair is wonderful and gives a definate interest to your waldo.  Very well done. (If this had not been the Wheres Waldo challenge I would have suggested a tighter crop to bri ng more focus to the lady, but your crop is completely appropriate here)  Well done and good luck!', '2005-01-09 11:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098203, 132004, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photograph, but after 5 minutes of looking I still do not see Waldo.  Perhaps just a little too well hid.  remember the DPC 5 second rule, most voters do not look at any photograph for more than 5 seconds, and that can kill your photo if the subject is too hard to find.</td>', 'This is a very interesting photograph, but after 5 minutes of looking I still do not see Waldo.  Perhaps just a little too well hid.  remember the DPC 5 second rule, most voters do not look at any photograph for more than 5 seconds, and that can kill your photo if the subject is too hard to find.', '2005-01-09 11:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098212, 133267, 1024, '<td valign="top">The atmospheric conditions are well represented here and I feel a little cold after looking at this photograph.  Excuse me while I go get a sweater.....OK I am back.  Great composition, great exposure.  The only (tiny) thing I might change is to decrease the amount of sky as it was such an overcast day.</td>', 'The atmospheric conditions are well represented here and I feel a little cold after looking at this photograph.  Excuse me while I go get a sweater.....OK I am back.  Great composition, great exposure.  The only (tiny) thing I might change is to decrease the amount of sky as it was such an overcast day.', '2005-01-09 12:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098219, 132270, 1024, '<td valign="top">Nice use of leading lines and very good composition.  I like the fact I did not have to search to hard to find your waldo, but he is also not "in my face".  great job!  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice use of leading lines and very good composition.  I like the fact I did not have to search to hard to find your waldo, but he is also not "in my face".  great job!  Good luck.', '2005-01-09 12:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098222, 131574, 26679, '<td valign="top">I like this composition, The Black and White rely works here.</td>', 'I like this composition, The Black and White rely works here.', '2005-01-09 12:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098227, 133044, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photograph in spite of, or maybe partially because of,  the telephone wires.  Great composition too.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photograph in spite of, or maybe partially because of,  the telephone wires.  Great composition too.  Good luck.', '2005-01-09 12:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1098236, 133193, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photograph.  I hope this is one of the photos you have hung on the wall and sent to all the grandparents</td>', 'This is a wonderful photograph.  I hope this is one of the photos you have hung on the wall and sent to all the grandparents', '2005-01-09 12:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
