(1098246, 133340, 1024, '<td valign="top">Whoa, I was halfway through your critique when I finally saw your waldo, I thought it was the deer at first.  This is one of those photos that needs more than the normal 5 seconds.  I hope other viewers are a bit more observant than I.</td>', 'Whoa, I was halfway through your critique when I finally saw your waldo, I thought it was the deer at first.  This is one of those photos that needs more than the normal 5 seconds.  I hope other viewers are a bit more observant than I.', '2005-01-09 12:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
