(1098777, 131440, 1827, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific idea for reinterpretting this statue.  I''m not sure if her pose is hiding her deliberately in order to better meet the challenge, but I think I''d prefer the photo more as a whole (challenge be damned) if she were more visible - positioned in such a way that she appears to simply be part of the statue until you look harder.  Might even light to see her in drab grey with a hat that is a throwback to the period the piece was made in.</td>', 'This is a terrific idea for reinterpretting this statue.  I''m not sure if her pose is hiding her deliberately in order to better meet the challenge, but I think I''d prefer the photo more as a whole (challenge be damned) if she were more visible - positioned in such a way that she appears to simply be part of the statue until you look harder.  Might even light to see her in drab grey with a hat that is a throwback to the period the piece was made in.', '2005-01-09 20:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
