(1099388, 133390, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I like the colors and lines. Good focus and lighting. Good job of hiding waldo but yet can find him easy enough. Only thing IMO i would of like see done to this photo is a perspective crop. I tried it in PS and it really lined up the vertical lines well and made me focus on the main area of the picture. Good Job</td>', 'Good shot. I like the colors and lines. Good focus and lighting. Good job of hiding waldo but yet can find him easy enough. Only thing IMO i would of like see done to this photo is a perspective crop. I tried it in PS and it really lined up the vertical lines well and made me focus on the main area of the picture. Good Job', '2005-01-10 03:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099392, 131720, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp colors and focus. Love the blue sky however I think you hid waldo a little to much. Good photograph.</td>', 'Nice crisp colors and focus. Love the blue sky however I think you hid waldo a little to much. Good photograph.', '2005-01-10 03:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
