(1099563, 131750, 31036, '<td valign="top">Excellent title!</td>', 'Excellent title!', '2005-01-10 08:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099582, 131956, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colours and the deep DOF. You included elements from the immediate foreground and mountains that are miles away. Your Waldo is well hidden. 8.</td>', 'I like the bright colours and the deep DOF. You included elements from the immediate foreground and mountains that are miles away. Your Waldo is well hidden. 8.', '2005-01-10 08:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099584, 132385, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your picture si much too dark, the tree and the person can hardly be seen, there are no interesting details. The ground is pitch black (at least on my screen), and should have been cropped away, as it doesn''t add to the image. 3.</td>', 'Your picture si much too dark, the tree and the person can hardly be seen, there are no interesting details. The ground is pitch black (at least on my screen), and should have been cropped away, as it doesn''t add to the image. 3.', '2005-01-10 08:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099588, 133377, 27845, '<td valign="top">Hm...seems like there were to persons on the slope. Your title doesn''t work then. Well, let''s pretend there was only one. There are many blown-out snow areas, and completely black areas in the wood. The composition isn''t very interesting or dynamic, but I have to admit that I don''T know how to improve that. I find wintersport pictures hard to do because of the strong highlight and shadow difference. Maybe a mountain instead of pure sky would have been better. 4.</td>', 'Hm...seems like there were to persons on the slope. Your title doesn''t work then. Well, let''s pretend there was only one. There are many blown-out snow areas, and completely black areas in the wood. The composition isn''t very interesting or dynamic, but I have to admit that I don''T know how to improve that. I find wintersport pictures hard to do because of the strong highlight and shadow difference. Maybe a mountain instead of pure sky would have been better. 4.', '2005-01-10 08:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099591, 131718, 27845, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand your choice of the title. Do you refer to the books in the back?<br/>I like the b´vibrant red, you might have brightened it a little. The picture is also tilted, a straight ''horizon'' would have been more harmonic. Your person is well hidden, blends in with the surrounding details. 5.</td>', 'I don''t understand your choice of the title. Do you refer to the books in the back?I like the b´vibrant red, you might have brightened it a little. The picture is also tilted, a straight ''horizon'' would have been more harmonic. Your person is well hidden, blends in with the surrounding details. 5.', '2005-01-10 09:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099593, 132662, 27845, '<td valign="top">A cool ruin. The sunset light gives it the special touch. I''m not sure whether I found Waldo on the left side or whether it is somthing else. Looks like a backpacker? You might have pushed the ornage-blue contrast a little more. Good composition. 9.</td>', 'A cool ruin. The sunset light gives it the special touch. I''m not sure whether I found Waldo on the left side or whether it is somthing else. Looks like a backpacker? You might have pushed the ornage-blue contrast a little more. Good composition. 9.', '2005-01-10 09:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099597, 132459, 27845, '<td valign="top">You should have chosen a real person. Your figurine isn''t even hidden very well. It looks as if you submitted a picture just for the sake of participating, without any efforts. Sorry if that sounds harsh. 2.</td>', 'You should have chosen a real person. Your figurine isn''t even hidden very well. It looks as if you submitted a picture just for the sake of participating, without any efforts. Sorry if that sounds harsh. 2.', '2005-01-10 09:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099600, 133044, 27845, '<td valign="top">Wow! Amazing colour! I like the silhouette effect and the yellow-red gradient. The slightly green grass gives it an interesting touch. The electricity pole is quite distracting, but the tree looks great, and your person blends in with it very well. How did you get Waldo up there? Or am I completely wrong, is Waldo somewhere else?<br/>If it wasn''t for the pole, I''d give you the full score --&gt; 9.</td>', 'Wow! Amazing colour! I like the silhouette effect and the yellow-red gradient. The slightly green grass gives it an interesting touch. The electricity pole is quite distracting, but the tree looks great, and your person blends in with it very well. How did you get Waldo up there? Or am I completely wrong, is Waldo somewhere else?If it wasn''t for the pole, I''d give you the full score --> 9.', '2005-01-10 09:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099679, 133207, 22970, '<td valign="top">Ouch, not where I would want waldo to be [behind blinds], next he will be behind bars. lol. Nice lighting and focus and waldo is hidden enough to make you look but not to hidden to not find. Your picture seems to be on a slant. A slight tilt crop to the left would of helped. Good job!</td>', 'Ouch, not where I would want waldo to be [behind blinds], next he will be behind bars. lol. Nice lighting and focus and waldo is hidden enough to make you look but not to hidden to not find. Your picture seems to be on a slant. A slight tilt crop to the left would of helped. Good job!', '2005-01-10 10:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099682, 133278, 22970, '<td valign="top">Great concept and technically good. Great Job!</td>', 'Great concept and technically good. Great Job!', '2005-01-10 10:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099684, 132908, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good picture but I think you hid waldo a little to much. Good Job</td>', 'Good picture but I think you hid waldo a little to much. Good Job', '2005-01-10 10:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099689, 133115, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good use of B&amp;W to blend waldo into the picture.</td>', 'Good use of B&W to blend waldo into the picture.', '2005-01-10 10:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099692, 131428, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, well done but waldos red strip on his had is distracting and gives him away quickly. Good Job!</td>', 'Nice picture, well done but waldos red strip on his had is distracting and gives him away quickly. Good Job!', '2005-01-10 10:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099700, 133474, 22970, '<td valign="top">Your picture is a little bland, not much contrast. White background would of been better IMO. The glass needed a little more texture but you did a good job of hiding waldo so that he could not be seen at the same time seen.</td>', 'Your picture is a little bland, not much contrast. White background would of been better IMO. The glass needed a little more texture but you did a good job of hiding waldo so that he could not be seen at the same time seen.', '2005-01-10 10:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099703, 133309, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and nice blend. Good Job!</td>', 'Nice capture and nice blend. Good Job!', '2005-01-10 10:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099705, 132758, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp and colorful shot but the reflections are distracting. I think I see Waldo''s hands at the table - first window from the door. Very busy picture.</td>', 'Nice crisp and colorful shot but the reflections are distracting. I think I see Waldo''s hands at the table - first window from the door. Very busy picture.', '2005-01-10 10:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099707, 132217, 22970, '<td valign="top">White balance off and the crop seem distracting. Waldo is more of a blur than an element of the photograph.</td>', 'White balance off and the crop seem distracting. Waldo is more of a blur than an element of the photograph.', '2005-01-10 10:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
