(1099712, 133118, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but IMO it would of looked better in B&amp;W. I copied your picture and tried it in PS and waldo does not stand out as much but still visible. Also the blue jacket and jeans along with the green bench is distracting. Still a good capture.</td>', 'Nice capture but IMO it would of looked better in B&W. I copied your picture and tried it in PS and waldo does not stand out as much but still visible. Also the blue jacket and jeans along with the green bench is distracting. Still a good capture.', '2005-01-10 10:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099715, 133354, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice POV and capture. Good DOF,mood, lighting and focus. Great Shot!</td>', 'Nice POV and capture. Good DOF,mood, lighting and focus. Great Shot!', '2005-01-10 10:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099720, 132273, 22970, '<td valign="top">I find it hard to get good light balance when taking a picture of fire, but you did a good job. I like the texture of the tire marks in the ground and the embers at the lower left of the fire. However I think your picture would of benefited more it taken from a higher POV. The way it is Waldo''s head blends in with the black area of the fire. IMO it would of been great if his silhouette could of been expressed by the reflection on the ground which you would of had to have a higher POV. As-is your photograph is good and merits a good score.</td>', 'I find it hard to get good light balance when taking a picture of fire, but you did a good job. I like the texture of the tire marks in the ground and the embers at the lower left of the fire. However I think your picture would of benefited more it taken from a higher POV. The way it is Waldo''s head blends in with the black area of the fire. IMO it would of been great if his silhouette could of been expressed by the reflection on the ground which you would of had to have a higher POV. As-is your photograph is good and merits a good score.', '2005-01-10 10:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099725, 132500, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice capture with your secondary horizon on the top third of the frame. Nice lighting keeping the snow a vivid white, which is hard to do sometimes. Ms. Waldo is not hid to well but thats OK. Good Picture</td>', 'Nice capture with your secondary horizon on the top third of the frame. Nice lighting keeping the snow a vivid white, which is hard to do sometimes. Ms. Waldo is not hid to well but thats OK. Good Picture', '2005-01-10 10:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099728, 133453, 22970, '<td valign="top">An average picture because there is no wow or punch to it. Sky is burned out in places and the picture it self is dark. I do see waldo crossing the street.</td>', 'An average picture because there is no wow or punch to it. Sky is burned out in places and the picture it self is dark. I do see waldo crossing the street.', '2005-01-10 10:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099731, 133333, 22970, '<td valign="top">I think we have a visual definition of what we mean when we say a busy picture [lol]. Creative idea but focus seem soft in a lot of areas especially Waldo''s eye. [5]</td>', 'I think we have a visual definition of what we mean when we say a busy picture [lol]. Creative idea but focus seem soft in a lot of areas especially Waldo''s eye. [5]', '2005-01-10 10:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099741, 131962, 22970, '<td valign="top">OK I have taken a second and third look at your picture and can not see waldo. As far as the picture the focus is soft and lacks contrast. You horizon is tilted downward on the right a bit. The picture had the potential to be good. Good luck in challenge. I have bumped up your score from my place holder in previous comment.</td>', 'OK I have taken a second and third look at your picture and can not see waldo. As far as the picture the focus is soft and lacks contrast. You horizon is tilted downward on the right a bit. The picture had the potential to be good. Good luck in challenge. I have bumped up your score from my place holder in previous comment.', '2005-01-10 10:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099797, 133271, 3569, '<td valign="top">which one is hidden?</td>', 'which one is hidden?', '2005-01-10 11:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099798, 132454, 3569, '<td valign="top">can''t see a hidden person.</td>', 'can''t see a hidden person.', '2005-01-10 11:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099800, 131716, 3569, '<td valign="top">a bit exposed for hiding</td>', 'a bit exposed for hiding', '2005-01-10 11:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099801, 133251, 3569, '<td valign="top">hidden, where are ya Wally</td>', 'hidden, where are ya Wally', '2005-01-10 11:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100023, 131731, 25899, '<td valign="top">Looked at it long but it just doesn''t seem to fit in any way with the subject.</td>', 'Looked at it long but it just doesn''t seem to fit in any way with the subject.', '2005-01-10 13:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100077, 133102, 30818, '<td valign="top">Very Creative and great quality!  I almost didn''t realize that the one on the right wasn''t a picture :)</td>', 'Very Creative and great quality!  I almost didn''t realize that the one on the right wasn''t a picture :)', '2005-01-10 13:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100090, 132943, 30818, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  The greens and blues in the background really complete this photo!</td>', 'Awesome shot!  The greens and blues in the background really complete this photo!', '2005-01-10 13:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100136, 133440, 30818, '<td valign="top">Cute picture of the dog, but it''s not such a falttering picture of the Waldo...  try to steer clear of up the nose shots!</td>', 'Cute picture of the dog, but it''s not such a falttering picture of the Waldo...  try to steer clear of up the nose shots!', '2005-01-10 14:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100170, 133131, 31840, '<td valign="top">Very creative!</td>', 'Very creative!', '2005-01-10 14:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100264, 131720, 15574, '<td valign="top">The Colors are really great and eye catching!</td>', 'The Colors are really great and eye catching!', '2005-01-10 16:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100267, 133353, 255, '<td valign="top">yes, this is very nice. i  love the rumpled but organized chaotic feel-- and the hint of our waldo peeking into the frame.  i am guessing this is jj? :)</td>', 'yes, this is very nice. i  love the rumpled but organized chaotic feel-- and the hint of our waldo peeking into the frame.  i am guessing this is jj? :)', '2005-01-10 16:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100281, 133207, 15574, '<td valign="top">LOL....funny, it would have been great if you had bubbles in the bath, and maybe some candles around the tub.</td>', 'LOL....funny, it would have been great if you had bubbles in the bath, and maybe some candles around the tub.', '2005-01-10 16:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100284, 133354, 15574, '<td valign="top">There is just something about this pic that makes me keep looking back at it. Great view &amp; time of day.</td>', 'There is just something about this pic that makes me keep looking back at it. Great view & time of day.', '2005-01-10 16:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100291, 133044, 15574, '<td valign="top">This is a really GREAT pic, the only thing that kind of bugs me is the slight horizon tilt.</td>', 'This is a really GREAT pic, the only thing that kind of bugs me is the slight horizon tilt.', '2005-01-10 16:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100406, 133394, 30818, '<td valign="top">Isn''t Waldo supposed to be a person?  Very cute idea though...</td>', 'Isn''t Waldo supposed to be a person?  Very cute idea though...', '2005-01-10 17:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100417, 133044, 29011, '<td valign="top">Hello :-) For me, this photo is one of the most inspiring of the bunch.</td>', 'Hello :-) For me, this photo is one of the most inspiring of the bunch.', '2005-01-10 17:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100421, 131731, 30818, '<td valign="top">This picture is small...  You should really try and use up the 640 px available to you.</td>', 'This picture is small...  You should really try and use up the 640 px available to you.', '2005-01-10 17:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100430, 133043, 30818, '<td valign="top">The ligting is a little off, the forground is darker than the back...  Great positioning of Waldo though...  I give it a 7 :)</td>', 'The ligting is a little off, the forground is darker than the back...  Great positioning of Waldo though...  I give it a 7 :)', '2005-01-10 17:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100438, 132826, 30818, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of distraction in this photo...  not to mention, I can''t seem to find Waldo although I trust that he''s there somewhere!</td>', 'There is a lot of distraction in this photo...  not to mention, I can''t seem to find Waldo although I trust that he''s there somewhere!', '2005-01-10 17:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100444, 132313, 30818, '<td valign="top">Although Waldo''s placement is good, the subject of your photo is not so great!</td>', 'Although Waldo''s placement is good, the subject of your photo is not so great!', '2005-01-10 17:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100447, 132684, 30818, '<td valign="top">Very E.T.-ish</td>', 'Very E.T.-ish', '2005-01-10 18:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100449, 132304, 30818, '<td valign="top">When taking nature pictures, try to bring out the natural colors a little more...  The only rich color in this photo is the jacket.</td>', 'When taking nature pictures, try to bring out the natural colors a little more...  The only rich color in this photo is the jacket.', '2005-01-10 18:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100453, 132246, 30818, '<td valign="top">Too small and blurry</td>', 'Too small and blurry', '2005-01-10 18:07:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1100491, 133455, 326, '<td valign="top">I see them... Good job!</td>', 'I see them... Good job!', '2005-01-10 18:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100575, 133102, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is simply wonderful... i think it would''ve been even better if the real pictures were framed, but still, this is a ten...</td>', 'this is simply wonderful... i think it would''ve been even better if the real pictures were framed, but still, this is a ten...', '2005-01-10 19:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100687, 131512, 25742, '<td valign="top">horizon tilted, which is strange for a frozen lake :)</td>', 'horizon tilted, which is strange for a frozen lake :)', '2005-01-10 21:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100710, 131440, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Gotta know where this is.<br/>TC</td>', 'Great shot!  Gotta know where this is.TC', '2005-01-10 22:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100713, 132246, 9906, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge (I had to look for a second)  But:  Very small.  Very harshly lit.  Very busy too with all the confllicting lines.  The size thing is easy to fix.  Do a search in the forums for resizing and you should find LOTS of help there.<br/>TC</td>', 'Fits the challenge (I had to look for a second)  But:  Very small.  Very harshly lit.  Very busy too with all the confllicting lines.  The size thing is easy to fix.  Do a search in the forums for resizing and you should find LOTS of help there.TC', '2005-01-10 22:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100715, 133340, 9906, '<td valign="top">While the shot meets the challenge it''s not a terribly interesting shot.  A couple of things kinda work against you here.  The panoramic style of the shot makes it look kinda awkward.  Your horizon line not being straight gives the shot a confusing angle.  I know it''s relatively straight because of the background trees, but it LOOKS crooked.  Also the forground (which is most of the shot) doesn''t really add anything to the shot.  Hope this don''t come off as harsh.  It''s meant to be  helpful.<br/>TC</td>', 'While the shot meets the challenge it''s not a terribly interesting shot.  A couple of things kinda work against you here.  The panoramic style of the shot makes it look kinda awkward.  Your horizon line not being straight gives the shot a confusing angle.  I know it''s relatively straight because of the background trees, but it LOOKS crooked.  Also the forground (which is most of the shot) doesn''t really add anything to the shot.  Hope this don''t come off as harsh.  It''s meant to be  helpful.TC', '2005-01-10 22:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100723, 133061, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject that shows some potential.  Where is this mirror and what is it''s purpose?  Did you desat the image in the mirror or is it a trick of the light?  Too bad your sky is so blah looking cause I think a nice blue sky would add greatly to this.  Centering the mirror in the shot (or cropping out further to give more room for a nicely off centered composition) would also help considerably.  This is definately a good candidate for reshooting!<br/>TC</td>', 'Interesting subject that shows some potential.  Where is this mirror and what is it''s purpose?  Did you desat the image in the mirror or is it a trick of the light?  Too bad your sky is so blah looking cause I think a nice blue sky would add greatly to this.  Centering the mirror in the shot (or cropping out further to give more room for a nicely off centered composition) would also help considerably.  This is definately a good candidate for reshooting!TC', '2005-01-10 22:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100727, 131428, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great tones and composition!  Love the way the trees lead you into the shot.  Fits the challenge well, but truthfully thing this shot would be even better without the guy leaning into the edge...<br/>TC</td>', 'Great tones and composition!  Love the way the trees lead you into the shot.  Fits the challenge well, but truthfully thing this shot would be even better without the guy leaning into the edge...TC', '2005-01-10 22:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100729, 131779, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very interesting POV!  Not sure I really like it on an artistic level, but it''s a great study shot in unusual point of view!  Oh, which one''s Waldo?<br/>TC</td>', 'Very interesting POV!  Not sure I really like it on an artistic level, but it''s a great study shot in unusual point of view!  Oh, which one''s Waldo?TC', '2005-01-10 22:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100733, 132535, 9906, '<td valign="top">I never have and probably never will appreciate overprocessed psychedelic type shots such as this.  Just not my cup of tea...<br/>TC</td>', 'I never have and probably never will appreciate overprocessed psychedelic type shots such as this.  Just not my cup of tea...TC', '2005-01-10 22:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100744, 133406, 9906, '<td valign="top">Dude, is this yours? (if you don''t know what I mean it ain''t you...)  We need to get you a new camera for real...  Fits the challenge, but it''s not all that interesting.  Your lighting has left an odd shadow line right down the middle of her face that looks, well, wrong.  Your colors are very flat also.  Noise and colors are prob only gonna be fixed when ya got a new weapon to point...<br/>TC</td>', 'Dude, is this yours? (if you don''t know what I mean it ain''t you...)  We need to get you a new camera for real...  Fits the challenge, but it''s not all that interesting.  Your lighting has left an odd shadow line right down the middle of her face that looks, well, wrong.  Your colors are very flat also.  Noise and colors are prob only gonna be fixed when ya got a new weapon to point...TC', '2005-01-10 22:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100829, 133347, 12448, '<td valign="top">Found him! ;)</td>', 'Found him! ;)', '2005-01-10 23:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101067, 133102, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very clever!<br/>Almost judged it too quickly then it was obvious. Well Done. ((8))<br/>And where have I seen her before?<br/> :)</td>', 'Very clever!Almost judged it too quickly then it was obvious. Well Done. ((8))And where have I seen her before? :)', '2005-01-11 04:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101184, 131739, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very noisy and lighting is off. Could of been a good picture. Good luck in challenge.</td>', 'Very noisy and lighting is off. Could of been a good picture. Good luck in challenge.', '2005-01-11 08:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101185, 133447, 22970, '<td valign="top">Creative but don''t see the use of B&amp;W as being a good thing in this picture. But I have not seen the colored version. Good lighting and overall focus.</td>', 'Creative but don''t see the use of B&W as being a good thing in this picture. But I have not seen the colored version. Good lighting and overall focus.', '2005-01-11 08:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101186, 132206, 6999, '<td valign="top">Don''t see anyone at all :-) I''m not sure about the strong barrel distortion, I feel that it doesn''t work for this scene - though I do very much like the light.</td>', 'Don''t see anyone at all :-) I''m not sure about the strong barrel distortion, I feel that it doesn''t work for this scene - though I do very much like the light.', '2005-01-11 08:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101188, 131495, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good concept but colors a bland without contrast. Good picture and focus.</td>', 'Good concept but colors a bland without contrast. Good picture and focus.', '2005-01-11 08:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101190, 133131, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good picture but a little small. Focas a bit soft.</td>', 'Good picture but a little small. Focas a bit soft.', '2005-01-11 08:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101191, 132376, 22970, '<td valign="top">Picture not to eye appealing but meets the challenge. Average! Good luck in challenge.</td>', 'Picture not to eye appealing but meets the challenge. Average! Good luck in challenge.', '2005-01-11 08:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101193, 132764, 22970, '<td valign="top">Composition off and imo to much blur.</td>', 'Composition off and imo to much blur.', '2005-01-11 08:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101194, 131968, 6999, '<td valign="top">After some moments of looking, this image seems tilted a touch - which adds I think an unneccesarily distracting dynamic to what is otherwise a very fine shot for the challenge. I particularly like the fact that the strongest compositional elements pull the eye towards the stairs, and your hidden figure is in the other direction.</td>', 'After some moments of looking, this image seems tilted a touch - which adds I think an unneccesarily distracting dynamic to what is otherwise a very fine shot for the challenge. I particularly like the fact that the strongest compositional elements pull the eye towards the stairs, and your hidden figure is in the other direction.', '2005-01-11 08:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101232, 133161, 31831, '<td valign="top">colorful, clear, subtle. very nice.</td>', 'colorful, clear, subtle. very nice.', '2005-01-11 09:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101233, 133043, 31831, '<td valign="top">good capture of person although the flash above subject is distracting.</td>', 'good capture of person although the flash above subject is distracting.', '2005-01-11 09:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101238, 133451, 31831, '<td valign="top">could the focus be reversed to accent the near and blur the far?</td>', 'could the focus be reversed to accent the near and blur the far?', '2005-01-11 09:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101241, 132916, 31831, '<td valign="top">subject not visible on my monitor.</td>', 'subject not visible on my monitor.', '2005-01-11 09:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101244, 131679, 31831, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2005-01-11 09:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101249, 133471, 31831, '<td valign="top">dark. hidden well but blurry.</td>', 'dark. hidden well but blurry.', '2005-01-11 09:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101251, 133347, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good Idea and well hid waldo. Sky a little bland and color not to vivid but average shot. Good luck in challenge.</td>', 'Good Idea and well hid waldo. Sky a little bland and color not to vivid but average shot. Good luck in challenge.', '2005-01-11 09:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101252, 132269, 31831, '<td valign="top">great detail capture and well hidden.</td>', 'great detail capture and well hidden.', '2005-01-11 09:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101259, 133085, 31831, '<td valign="top">dark yet deatiled. the lighting has a good effect.</td>', 'dark yet deatiled. the lighting has a good effect.', '2005-01-11 09:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101260, 131962, 31831, '<td valign="top">seems colors are conflicting.</td>', 'seems colors are conflicting.', '2005-01-11 09:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101264, 133118, 31831, '<td valign="top">subject blurry but in good Waldo pose.</td>', 'subject blurry but in good Waldo pose.', '2005-01-11 09:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101269, 132336, 27845, '<td valign="top">Can''t find Waldo :( Great picture. 7.</td>', 'Can''t find Waldo :( Great picture. 7.', '2005-01-11 09:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101271, 133469, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery but colors a little washed and your horizon needs leveling other than that good shot. Hope Waldo catches some fish.</td>', 'Nice scenery but colors a little washed and your horizon needs leveling other than that good shot. Hope Waldo catches some fish.', '2005-01-11 09:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101276, 133024, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery shot with good color. Good placement of Waldo. One of the best seen so far.</td>', 'Nice scenery shot with good color. Good placement of Waldo. One of the best seen so far.', '2005-01-11 09:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101295, 133370, 22970, '<td valign="top">Your photograph seems to be over saturated and sharpened. IMO Waldo stands out a bit to much. Lighting OK and I think it would of looked better if you would of brought your horizon [grass edge] up to the third line and level, its on a slight tilt. And I wonder if it would of looked better in B&amp;W since you are conveying mood here. With that said, it is a good picture.</td>', 'Your photograph seems to be over saturated and sharpened. IMO Waldo stands out a bit to much. Lighting OK and I think it would of looked better if you would of brought your horizon [grass edge] up to the third line and level, its on a slight tilt. And I wonder if it would of looked better in B&W since you are conveying mood here. With that said, it is a good picture.', '2005-01-11 10:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101302, 133380, 31831, '<td valign="top">not blended.</td>', 'not blended.', '2005-01-11 10:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101306, 131428, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the way Waldo leans into the frame. The overall picture seems pale because of the mist. It lacks contrast. 6.</td>', 'I like the way Waldo leans into the frame. The overall picture seems pale because of the mist. It lacks contrast. 6.', '2005-01-11 10:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101307, 131546, 31831, '<td valign="top">coloring is nice.</td>', 'coloring is nice.', '2005-01-11 10:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101310, 133406, 31831, '<td valign="top">appears to be over-sharpened.</td>', 'appears to be over-sharpened.', '2005-01-11 10:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101312, 133222, 27845, '<td valign="top">The title fits the picture very well. I like the reflection of the trees in the frouen river/pond. But at the same time the water creates a large empty space that you should fill somehow. 6.</td>', 'The title fits the picture very well. I like the reflection of the trees in the frouen river/pond. But at the same time the water creates a large empty space that you should fill somehow. 6.', '2005-01-11 10:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101313, 132252, 31831, '<td valign="top">good colors and blending.</td>', 'good colors and blending.', '2005-01-11 10:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101317, 132273, 27845, '<td valign="top">Looks hot. You should have cropped away the black part on the left (about 1/6 of the image width). I love the reflections in the water puddles. The horizon looks tilted. The colours are great. 8.</td>', 'Looks hot. You should have cropped away the black part on the left (about 1/6 of the image width). I love the reflections in the water puddles. The horizon looks tilted. The colours are great. 8.', '2005-01-11 10:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101319, 133115, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your person is well hidden, but the trees and branches destroy the picture''s structure. It''s too confusing. 4.</td>', 'Your person is well hidden, but the trees and branches destroy the picture''s structure. It''s too confusing. 4.', '2005-01-11 10:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101327, 132978, 27845, '<td valign="top">The title makes the picture quite funny, but I think the shot wouldn''t work without it very well. I can''t see anybody, unless you''r referring to the plane''s pilot. The grey sky is ugly. I know you have no control over the weather condition, but the plane blends in to much with the sky. The picture needs more colour and contrast. 5.</td>', 'The title makes the picture quite funny, but I think the shot wouldn''t work without it very well. I can''t see anybody, unless you''r referring to the plane''s pilot. The grey sky is ugly. I know you have no control over the weather condition, but the plane blends in to much with the sky. The picture needs more colour and contrast. 5.', '2005-01-11 10:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101328, 132273, 31831, '<td valign="top">colors seem conflicting. maybe could be balanced a bit.</td>', 'colors seem conflicting. maybe could be balanced a bit.', '2005-01-11 10:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101330, 133263, 27845, '<td valign="top">The shadow cast is unfortunate. It looks as if Walda had a beard and moustache... 5.</td>', 'The shadow cast is unfortunate. It looks as if Walda had a beard and moustache... 5.', '2005-01-11 10:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101331, 132981, 31831, '<td valign="top">I like how the detail is captured both near and far.</td>', 'I like how the detail is captured both near and far.', '2005-01-11 10:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101334, 132304, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice alliteration. I can''t find Waldo though. The colours arr nice. Your picture makes me want to go to that place. A bit messy, there should be a clearer structure. 5.</td>', 'Nice alliteration. I can''t find Waldo though. The colours arr nice. Your picture makes me want to go to that place. A bit messy, there should be a clearer structure. 5.', '2005-01-11 10:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101335, 133081, 31831, '<td valign="top">nice.</td>', 'nice.', '2005-01-11 10:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101340, 131853, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool. I like the blue colour cast, the repetition of the windows and the lines they imply along with the ceiling bows and the rows in the ground. The reflection in the floor gives it a modern touch. You chose an interesting perspective. 9.</td>', 'Cool. I like the blue colour cast, the repetition of the windows and the lines they imply along with the ceiling bows and the rows in the ground. The reflection in the floor gives it a modern touch. You chose an interesting perspective. 9.', '2005-01-11 10:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101341, 132950, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice colour. Your person is well hidden, but the picture need more structure. The trees blend with each other and melt with the ground. 5.</td>', 'Nice colour. Your person is well hidden, but the picture need more structure. The trees blend with each other and melt with the ground. 5.', '2005-01-11 10:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101343, 132313, 31831, '<td valign="top">this is good.</td>', 'this is good.', '2005-01-11 10:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101346, 132269, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the guiding lines and the strong green colour. Your person is well hidden, but can still be found. You did a good setup and lighting. 9.</td>', 'I like the guiding lines and the strong green colour. Your person is well hidden, but can still be found. You did a good setup and lighting. 9.', '2005-01-11 10:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101350, 133333, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your title is very confusing and so is your picture, but I think that''s it''s best feature. I commented in some other pictures that they need more structure. This one has no structure at all, but works well nonetheless. I don''t know how you did that. Your Waldo has found an intersting hiding place, but he should have been in focus nonetheless. 7.</td>', 'Your title is very confusing and so is your picture, but I think that''s it''s best feature. I commented in some other pictures that they need more structure. This one has no structure at all, but works well nonetheless. I don''t know how you did that. Your Waldo has found an intersting hiding place, but he should have been in focus nonetheless. 7.', '2005-01-11 10:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101354, 132506, 31831, '<td valign="top">nice photo. edges appear over-sharpened.</td>', 'nice photo. edges appear over-sharpened.', '2005-01-11 10:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101365, 133267, 31831, '<td valign="top">it seems cloudy all across the middle.</td>', 'it seems cloudy all across the middle.', '2005-01-11 10:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101370, 133166, 31831, '<td valign="top">yep, he blended in.</td>', 'yep, he blended in.', '2005-01-11 10:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101387, 133453, 31831, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting and the angle. lucky timing on this shot. great job!</td>', 'I really like the lighting and the angle. lucky timing on this shot. great job!', '2005-01-11 10:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101397, 131618, 27845, '<td valign="top">WOW! This looks awesome. The best thing about his picture is it''s immediate impact on the viever. It has got a clear, defined structure which stands out firmly against the dark areas. It took me a minute to figure out what this was. I used the same idea for my submission, but yours turned out way better! The DOF is great, the picture is perfectly sharo all the way to the top. The eye is irrevocably drawn to the picture''s center, and passes Waldo on it''s way. Your person is well placed. It breaks up the symmetry of the floor repetitions, but doesn''t stand out too much, it doesn''t destroy the symmetry, but actually adds interest to it.<br/>I also like the reflections of the light on the fence (good exposure by the way, nothings blown out, and the black is pure black).<br/>I give you a ten and add you to my favourites. Good luck!</td>', 'WOW! This looks awesome. The best thing about his picture is it''s immediate impact on the viever. It has got a clear, defined structure which stands out firmly against the dark areas. It took me a minute to figure out what this was. I used the same idea for my submission, but yours turned out way better! The DOF is great, the picture is perfectly sharo all the way to the top. The eye is irrevocably drawn to the picture''s center, and passes Waldo on it''s way. Your person is well placed. It breaks up the symmetry of the floor repetitions, but doesn''t stand out too much, it doesn''t destroy the symmetry, but actually adds interest to it.I also like the reflections of the light on the fence (good exposure by the way, nothings blown out, and the black is pure black).I give you a ten and add you to my favourites. Good luck!', '2005-01-11 10:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101420, 132291, 27845, '<td valign="top">Really colourful. I don''t like the way you hide your person though, and the main impact from your picture comes from the painted wall, which is actually a piece of art in itself. I feel that you didn''t do to much to the merit of this shot. Well, I give you a 7 nonetheless.</td>', 'Really colourful. I don''t like the way you hide your person though, and the main impact from your picture comes from the painted wall, which is actually a piece of art in itself. I feel that you didn''t do to much to the merit of this shot. Well, I give you a 7 nonetheless.', '2005-01-11 10:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101430, 131731, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool picture, but I don''t think it meets the challenge. There''s nobody hidden in it, is there?<br/>You should also have submitted a larger image if your camera allow you to. Always chose the largest width or height possible, which is 640 pixel. 4. (Which is a lot for a small picture that doesn''t meet the challenge.)</td>', 'Cool picture, but I don''t think it meets the challenge. There''s nobody hidden in it, is there?You should also have submitted a larger image if your camera allow you to. Always chose the largest width or height possible, which is 640 pixel. 4. (Which is a lot for a small picture that doesn''t meet the challenge.)', '2005-01-11 10:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101438, 131749, 27845, '<td valign="top">The large white sky should have been cropped away. For the rest: good composition, interesting point opf view. The picture is a bit overexposed and needs some contrast and darkening. DOF is fine, b&amp;w was a good choice. 6.</td>', 'The large white sky should have been cropped away. For the rest: good composition, interesting point opf view. The picture is a bit overexposed and needs some contrast and darkening. DOF is fine, b&w was a good choice. 6.', '2005-01-11 10:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101464, 133053, 27845, '<td valign="top">Wow. Looks great. Is Waldo a statue? He looks quite big compared to the hill.<br/>I love those clouds, and the detail in the hills, and the curves in the street, and the view on the village, and the triangular composition, and the DOF, and the sharpness, and the ribbon right next to the file name ;) 10.<br/>Edit: I just noticed that there are people on the street...strange, now I''m not so sure where Waldo actually is. I still think you''r referring to the figure on the hilltop.</td>', 'Wow. Looks great. Is Waldo a statue? He looks quite big compared to the hill.I love those clouds, and the detail in the hills, and the curves in the street, and the view on the village, and the triangular composition, and the DOF, and the sharpness, and the ribbon right next to the file name ;) 10.Edit: I just noticed that there are people on the street...strange, now I''m not so sure where Waldo actually is. I still think you''r referring to the figure on the hilltop.', '2005-01-11 10:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
