(1101772, 132826, 31133, '<td valign="top">I guess Waldo is the white horse? This is a beautiful picture, especially the stormy part of the sky and the sharpness and colors of the brown horse. It looks like a beautiful place! I could never in a million years get a shot as nice as this, but just for my own training, I''ll say that I think it would be really nice without the white trailer in the background. But that is just nit-picky because I''m jealous :-)</td>', 'I guess Waldo is the white horse? This is a beautiful picture, especially the stormy part of the sky and the sharpness and colors of the brown horse. It looks like a beautiful place! I could never in a million years get a shot as nice as this, but just for my own training, I''ll say that I think it would be really nice without the white trailer in the background. But that is just nit-picky because I''m jealous :-)', '2005-01-11 14:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
