(1102356, 133455, 31903, '<td valign="top">I just really dig on this whole photo. You don''t really want to find Waldo because there is so much to look at. The wite on the right helps give depth but is a bit distracting over all. I usually don''t like sepia prints but this is an exception.</td>', 'I just really dig on this whole photo. You don''t really want to find Waldo because there is so much to look at. The wite on the right helps give depth but is a bit distracting over all. I usually don''t like sepia prints but this is an exception.', '2005-01-11 21:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
