(1102698, 133451, 29513, '<td valign="top">Some folks said that they had trouble finding the "Waldo."  Look along the left side of the thermometer tube.  It is a face that is elongated vertically turned a bit to the right but looking right at you.  It is a reflection.<br/> <br/>Thanks for taking the time to vote and comment.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-12 10:56:13.</i></td>', 'Some folks said that they had trouble finding the "Waldo."  Look along the left side of the thermometer tube.  It is a face that is elongated vertically turned a bit to the right but looking right at you.  It is a reflection. Thanks for taking the time to vote and comment.', '2005-01-12 00:11:56.000000', '2005-01-12 10:56:13.000000', 0),
