(1102702, 133267, 1570, '<td valign="top">thanks for your comments... tried to make a gloomy picture, and that''s exactly what i got... i still like it, glad that some of you guys did, too... even two tens, wow! was interesting comparing "Gracechild7" and "BAMartin" comments... "graphicfunk", you are such a sweetheart!<br/> <br/>now that you found my waldo, can you see the dawg???</td>', 'thanks for your comments... tried to make a gloomy picture, and that''s exactly what i got... i still like it, glad that some of you guys did, too... even two tens, wow! was interesting comparing "Gracechild7" and "BAMartin" comments... "graphicfunk", you are such a sweetheart! now that you found my waldo, can you see the dawg???', '2005-01-12 00:12:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1102705, 133193, 13389, '<td valign="top">One of the most faithful to the actual theme - Waldo''s unique face in a crowd of faces. Most of the other entries hid just one small person somewhere in a landscape.</td>', 'One of the most faithful to the actual theme - Waldo''s unique face in a crowd of faces. Most of the other entries hid just one small person somewhere in a landscape.', '2005-01-12 00:13:15.000000', NULL, 0),
