(1102711, 132629, 30552, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by e301:</b></div><hr/><i> This has become rather flat - I don''t get much sense of depth from this lighting - everything''s pretty bright and full on, rather than using a graduation of shading across the set-up. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You are correct about it being flat. I''m not very happy with it myself.<br/>Know to learn how I could have done it different. :)<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments...</td>', 'Originally posted by e301: This has become rather flat - I don''t get much sense of depth from this lighting - everything''s pretty bright and full on, rather than using a graduation of shading across the set-up.   You are correct about it being flat. I''m not very happy with it myself.Know to learn how I could have done it different. :) Thanks for all the comments...', '2005-01-12 00:14:31.000000', NULL, 0),
