(1102814, 133471, 22479, '<td valign="top">Maybe my LCD is tuned up a bit more than the average voter, but I thought you got the exposure right for this composition. Too bad it did not do so well, thought it would perform better. Good luck.</td>', 'Maybe my LCD is tuned up a bit more than the average voter, but I thought you got the exposure right for this composition. Too bad it did not do so well, thought it would perform better. Good luck.', '2005-01-12 00:34:22.000000', NULL, 0),
