(1102833, 133053, 25426, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments. Initially I was a bit uncertain as to put this photo in the challenge because of multiple people in the frame, but I glad it did well to get in the top 10.</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments. Initially I was a bit uncertain as to put this photo in the challenge because of multiple people in the frame, but I glad it did well to get in the top 10.', '2005-01-12 00:40:49.000000', NULL, 0),
