(1102863, 133455, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wow--what great tones.  Rose toning?  Is that Waldo on the terrace?  Looks like we ended  up being neighbors on this one, LOL.  One thing I noticed on this but didn''t have time to comment: a slight perspective correction would have made the lines straighter.  Something to think about if you are shooting for the architecture challenge--though I am sure you know more about that than me anyway!<br/> <br/>Edit: Oops--I realize you could not adjust perspective here for the open challenge!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-12 07:41:35.</i></td>', 'Wow--what great tones.  Rose toning?  Is that Waldo on the terrace?  Looks like we ended  up being neighbors on this one, LOL.  One thing I noticed on this but didn''t have time to comment: a slight perspective correction would have made the lines straighter.  Something to think about if you are shooting for the architecture challenge--though I am sure you know more about that than me anyway! Edit: Oops--I realize you could not adjust perspective here for the open challenge!', '2005-01-12 00:54:47.000000', '2005-01-12 07:41:35.000000', 0),
(1102869, 131618, 12253, '<td valign="top">I knew this would ribbon!  Great work.  Congrats.</td>', 'I knew this would ribbon!  Great work.  Congrats.', '2005-01-12 00:57:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1102871, 133471, 23913, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by snackwells:</b></div><hr/><i> Maybe my LCD is tuned up a bit more than the average voter, but I thought you got the exposure right for this composition. Too bad it did not do so well, thought it would perform better. Good luck. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>thanx live and learn, right?</td>', 'Originally posted by snackwells: Maybe my LCD is tuned up a bit more than the average voter, but I thought you got the exposure right for this composition. Too bad it did not do so well, thought it would perform better. Good luck.   thanx live and learn, right?', '2005-01-12 00:58:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1102872, 133452, 22479, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your kind comments, everyone. I didn''t expect this one to place so high and was pleasantly surprised with the results! Almost embarassing but I got my personal best with this shot using my wife''s P&amp;S PowerShot S410.</td>', 'Thanks for your kind comments, everyone. I didn''t expect this one to place so high and was pleasantly surprised with the results! Almost embarassing but I got my personal best with this shot using my wife''s P&S PowerShot S410.', '2005-01-12 00:58:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1102930, 132270, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot!  I thought this would be top 10 for sure!  Nice work--into my favs!</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot!  I thought this would be top 10 for sure!  Nice work--into my favs!', '2005-01-12 01:20:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1102939, 132741, 19952, '<td valign="top">There were a lot of great shots in this challenge, but this was my favorite by far. It''s one of the most creative photos I''ve ever seen. It''s too bad that it was so creative that some people had trouble telling what was going on, (took me awhile too!) but I hope that doesn''t keep you from coming up with more briliant shots like this for future challenges. Really great job!</td>', 'There were a lot of great shots in this challenge, but this was my favorite by far. It''s one of the most creative photos I''ve ever seen. It''s too bad that it was so creative that some people had trouble telling what was going on, (took me awhile too!) but I hope that doesn''t keep you from coming up with more briliant shots like this for future challenges. Really great job!', '2005-01-12 01:22:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1102958, 133457, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really liked the dark tone of this shot and thought it was a perfect image for this challenge. Very well done!</td>', 'I really liked the dark tone of this shot and thought it was a perfect image for this challenge. Very well done!', '2005-01-12 01:28:55.000000', NULL, 0),
