(1103114, 131618, 5354, '<td valign="top">Tremendous, I had this one tagged as blue.<br/>Great photo, well done.</td>', 'Tremendous, I had this one tagged as blue.Great photo, well done.', '2005-01-12 03:02:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1103118, 131440, 29513, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite of the Waldo 2 challenge.  I really like the "hidden in plain view" quality.  Great idea nicely executed.</td>', 'This was my favorite of the Waldo 2 challenge.  I really like the "hidden in plain view" quality.  Great idea nicely executed.', '2005-01-12 03:08:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1103149, 133102, 24961, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much for all your comments. I am glad to make "best 10". And I am happy that I managed to make that effect of obviosity. That a lot of people thought from the first look that there were THREE paintings and only then realised Where was my Waldo. And yes, BradP and kiwiness, you saw that "model" on my "Peeping Tom" shot and on the author''s photo on my profile page LOL. In this picture there is no editing except correcting levels a bit, USM and crop. So, no cloning or dodging, anyway it is not alowed in basic editing LOL.</td>', 'Thank you very much for all your comments. I am glad to make "best 10". And I am happy that I managed to make that effect of obviosity. That a lot of people thought from the first look that there were THREE paintings and only then realised Where was my Waldo. And yes, BradP and kiwiness, you saw that "model" on my "Peeping Tom" shot and on the author''s photo on my profile page LOL. In this picture there is no editing except correcting levels a bit, USM and crop. So, no cloning or dodging, anyway it is not alowed in basic editing LOL.', '2005-01-12 03:39:18.000000', NULL, 0);
