(1103444, 132004, 7889, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BAMartin:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a very interesting photograph, but after 5 minutes of looking I still do not see Waldo.  Perhaps just a little too well hid.  remember the DPC 5 second rule, most voters do not look at any photograph for more than 5 seconds, and that can kill your photo if the subject is too hard to find. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The idea of the challenge was to ''hide'' waldo! This challenge required the viewer to search the picture not just give it a glance and then move on!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by BAMartin: This is a very interesting photograph, but after 5 minutes of looking I still do not see Waldo.  Perhaps just a little too well hid.  remember the DPC 5 second rule, most voters do not look at any photograph for more than 5 seconds, and that can kill your photo if the subject is too hard to find.   The idea of the challenge was to ''hide'' waldo! This challenge required the viewer to search the picture not just give it a glance and then move on! ', '2005-01-12 07:29:44.000000', NULL, 0),
