(1103563, 132950, 31264, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments people, I agree that the trees make it look cluttered, I was sort of aiming for that effect, lots of clutter like the proper where''s waldo pictures - I wasn''t allowed to clutter it with people though.<br/> <br/>I also agree with puzzled that''s nothing more than okay, and it''s not immediately obvious how to improve it - I think just a better subject and a better photographer.  <br/> <br/>But I''m well chuffed with 89th so thanks!</td>', 'Thanks for the comments people, I agree that the trees make it look cluttered, I was sort of aiming for that effect, lots of clutter like the proper where''s waldo pictures - I wasn''t allowed to clutter it with people though. I also agree with puzzled that''s nothing more than okay, and it''s not immediately obvious how to improve it - I think just a better subject and a better photographer.   But I''m well chuffed with 89th so thanks!', '2005-01-12 09:18:17.000000', NULL, 0),
