(1104237, 131630, 7438, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments people, really appreciated.<br/> <br/>And regarding the comment that it was too dark for a late afternoon: I agree, and perhaps ''a late night coffee'' would''ve been more appropriate, but this is actually taken at around 4 PM if I recall correctly. This time of year in Iceland the sun rises between noon and 1PM, and goes back down at around 4 PM. It''s pretty surreal, and I suspect magnus can vouch for this ;)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments people, really appreciated. And regarding the comment that it was too dark for a late afternoon: I agree, and perhaps ''a late night coffee'' would''ve been more appropriate, but this is actually taken at around 4 PM if I recall correctly. This time of year in Iceland the sun rises between noon and 1PM, and goes back down at around 4 PM. It''s pretty surreal, and I suspect magnus can vouch for this ;)', '2005-01-12 14:33:22.000000', NULL, 0),
