(1105493, 133452, 16301, '<td valign="top">I think the composition here is excellent, with all these straight and curved lines in the frame. My only nitpick here is the color, the whites seem to have a red/pink color cast to them, so I think it would have looked much more better in B&amp;W. I would have also placed your wife a bit more to the left. A great photo otherwise...</td>', 'I think the composition here is excellent, with all these straight and curved lines in the frame. My only nitpick here is the color, the whites seem to have a red/pink color cast to them, so I think it would have looked much more better in B&W. I would have also placed your wife a bit more to the left. A great photo otherwise...', '2005-01-13 06:20:44.000000', NULL, 0),
