(1106082, 133451, 31133, '<td valign="top">Oh! Now I see the Waldo and can''t for the life of me understand that I missed him - good thing you pointed it out and I''m sorry I didn''t see him when I wrote my comment below. It''s funny to me how now that he''s been pointed out, I can''t *not* see him.</td>', 'Oh! Now I see the Waldo and can''t for the life of me understand that I missed him - good thing you pointed it out and I''m sorry I didn''t see him when I wrote my comment below. It''s funny to me how now that he''s been pointed out, I can''t *not* see him.', '2005-01-13 15:26:46.000000', NULL, 0),
