(1106864, 132741, 23458, '<td valign="top">Yeah - talk about ripped off :) - this belonged somewhere in the top five. I''m really surprised that some people had trouble seeing the hand. I assumed you might suffer because you only included a hand and not a whole person (I didn''t think that would be an issue, but according to about half of the comments on my submission it was), but again didn''t think you''d have the problem it seemed you had.</td>', 'Yeah - talk about ripped off :) - this belonged somewhere in the top five. I''m really surprised that some people had trouble seeing the hand. I assumed you might suffer because you only included a hand and not a whole person (I didn''t think that would be an issue, but according to about half of the comments on my submission it was), but again didn''t think you''d have the problem it seemed you had.', '2005-01-14 00:37:57.000000', NULL, 0),
