(1113698, 132426, 5354, '<td valign="top">No, no, no its terrible, over exposed, highlights blown, no detail in the shadows, composition is awful, doesn''t meet the challenge at all. Sorry Brad this is just too bad to make any useful comments on - it should be DQ''d .....<br/> <br/>Bah I wish I could take photos so badly ;-)<br/> <br/>Truly a great capture !!<br/> <br/>All the best <br/>Falc</td>', 'No, no, no its terrible, over exposed, highlights blown, no detail in the shadows, composition is awful, doesn''t meet the challenge at all. Sorry Brad this is just too bad to make any useful comments on - it should be DQ''d ..... Bah I wish I could take photos so badly ;-) Truly a great capture !! All the best Falc', '2005-01-17 04:45:35.000000', NULL, 0),
