(1211343, 133222, 34641, '<td valign="top">Very Nice. Your photo brings back some memories.<br/><i>Background: Spent some time at a guest ranch (Rainbow Trout Ranch) near there and fished in the Conejos (in warmer weather).</i></td>', 'Very Nice. Your photo brings back some memories.Background: Spent some time at a guest ranch (Rainbow Trout Ranch) near there and fished in the Conejos (in warmer weather).', '2005-03-06 23:47:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1225939, 132828, 2798, '<td valign="top">This is the most "snapshoty" of your images that I''ve seen so far. There''s no real plan or framework to the elements in the image and so my eye hunts around without ever really stopping anywhere. The gulls in the foreground are both over exposed and unsharp due to their motion. The background and waldo are under exposed and muddy.</td>', 'This is the most "snapshoty" of your images that I''ve seen so far. There''s no real plan or framework to the elements in the image and so my eye hunts around without ever really stopping anywhere. The gulls in the foreground are both over exposed and unsharp due to their motion. The background and waldo are under exposed and muddy.', '2005-03-14 05:06:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1285657, 132304, 9581, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, theres a lot of trees like that around here...</td>', 'I like this shot, theres a lot of trees like that around here...', '2005-04-12 12:45:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1399170, 133380, 23680, '<td valign="top">Great artwork in the background and clever take on the challenge. I like the fact that you chose black and white.  I would like to see it cropped to that the little hand is more towards the bottom right corner</td>', 'Great artwork in the background and clever take on the challenge. I like the fact that you chose black and white.  I would like to see it cropped to that the little hand is more towards the bottom right corner', '2005-05-19 19:18:13.000000', NULL, 0),
